==================================================
TMU Library Seat Tracker - Backend Server
==================================================
Starting server at http://localhost:5000
API endpoints:
  GET  /api/floors              - Get floor configs
  GET  /api/floors/<n>/seats    - Get seats for floor
  GET  /api/floors/<n>/rooms    - Get rooms for floor
  POST /api/seats/book          - Book a seat
  POST /api/rooms/book          - Book a room
  GET  /api/bookings            - Get bookings
  DELETE /api/bookings/<id>     - Cancel booking
  GET  /api/stats               - Get statistics
